  "releaseNotes": "Version 0.1.0 - Initial Release:\n      • Universal base entities (BaseEntity, AuditableEntity, UserTrackedEntity, DomainEntity, UserOwnedEntity)\n      • Automatic audit trail with AuditInterceptor\n      • Built-in soft delete functionality\n      • Entity state management and locking\n      • Multi-tenant support with UserOwnedEntity\n      • Framework-agnostic design with minimal dependencies\n      • Full Entity Framework Core integration\n      • Comprehensive documentation and examples",
